{"source_id":"W740","platform":"RSS","author":"GamesIndustry.biz","account_type":"メディア","text":"Nintendo confirms Switch 1 consoles will be withdrawn from Europe following EU law change on batteries\n<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/switch_oled_TxDzrI3.jpg?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp\" /> <p>Nintendo has confirmed that sales of its original Switch console system - including its Lite and OLED models - will be discontinued in Europe next year.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/nintendo-confirms-switch-1-consoles-will-be-withdrawn-from-europe-following-eu-law-change-on-batteries\">Read more</a></p>","url":"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/nintendo-confirms-switch-1-consoles-will-be-withdrawn-from-europe-following-eu-law-change-on-batteries","timestamp":"2026-07-08T18:17:11Z","extra":{"source_priority":"medium","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
{"source_id":"W740","platform":"RSS","author":"GamesIndustry.biz","account_type":"メディア","text":"Build a Rocket Boy staff to protest upcoming \"all-expenses-paid\" fan event\n<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/mindseye-build-a-rocket-boy-(9).jpg?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp\" /> <p>Build a Rocket Boy (BARB) staff have organized a protest outside the studio's Edinburgh offices this weekend in response to an \"all-expenses-paid\" fan event.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/build-a-rocket-boy-staff-to-protest-upcoming-all-expenses-paid-fan-event\">Read more</a></p>","url":"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/build-a-rocket-boy-staff-to-protest-upcoming-all-expenses-paid-fan-event","timestamp":"2026-07-08T17:07:40Z","extra":{"source_priority":"medium","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
{"source_id":"W740","platform":"RSS","author":"GamesIndustry.biz","account_type":"メディア","text":"Premium mobile games are back, with releases up 77% in 2025\n<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/planet-of-lana_lSfihNV.jpg?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp\" /> <p>In unexpected but welcome news, premium mobile games are seeing a resurgence, after years in which free-to-play has been seen as the only option worth pursuing.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/premium-mobile-games-are-back-with-releases-up-77-in-2025\">Read more</a></p>","url":"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/premium-mobile-games-are-back-with-releases-up-77-in-2025","timestamp":"2026-07-08T14:26:16Z","extra":{"source_priority":"medium","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
{"source_id":"W740","platform":"RSS","author":"GamesIndustry.biz","account_type":"メディア","text":"Mario Kart Tour to shut down in September 2026\n<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/mario-kart-tour_F1Hjwpk.jpg?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp\" /> <p>Nintendo has announced that Mario Kart Tour <a href=\"https://www.ign.com/articles/nintendo-confirms-mario-kart-tour-shutdown-after-7-years-no-offline-version-offered\"> will go offline</a> on iOS and Android in September 2026.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/mario-kart-tour-to-shut-down-in-september-2026\">Read more</a></p>","url":"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/mario-kart-tour-to-shut-down-in-september-2026","timestamp":"2026-07-08T13:44:23Z","extra":{"source_priority":"medium","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
{"source_id":"W740","platform":"RSS","author":"GamesIndustry.biz","account_type":"メディア","text":"\"Workers deserve protection, not to be treated like disposable line items\" – Hundreds of union members affected by Xbox layoffs\n<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/jonathan-kemper-kLqpttf2wGE-unsplash-(1).jpg?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp\" /> <p>Hundreds of union members from the Communication Workers of America were affected by the <a href=\"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/xbox-to-reduce-workforce-by-3200-five-studios-to-be-divested\"> mass layoffs at Xbox this week</a>.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/workers-deserve-protection-not-to-be-treated-like-disposable-line-items-hundreds-of-union-members-affected-by-xbox-layoffs\">Read more</a></p>","url":"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/workers-deserve-protection-not-to-be-treated-like-disposable-line-items-hundreds-of-union-members-affected-by-xbox-layoffs","timestamp":"2026-07-08T10:45:45Z","extra":{"source_priority":"medium","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
{"source_id":"W740","platform":"RSS","author":"GamesIndustry.biz","account_type":"メディア","text":"Nexon to assume publishing duties for Overwatch on PC in South Korea\n<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/overwatch_clYfSXF.jpg?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp\" /> <p>Blizzard will transfer publishing duties for Overwatch on PC in South Korea to Nexon next month.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/nexon-to-assume-publishing-duties-for-overwatch-on-pc-in-south-korea\">Read more</a></p>","url":"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/nexon-to-assume-publishing-duties-for-overwatch-on-pc-in-south-korea","timestamp":"2026-07-08T09:15:21Z","extra":{"source_priority":"medium","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
{"source_id":"W740","platform":"RSS","author":"GamesIndustry.biz","account_type":"メディア","text":"\"There's a wealth of talent here, our focus is on how to leverage and support it\" – Atari appoints Andreas Deptolla as Atari Europe president\n<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/Atari-0101.png?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp\" /> <p>Atari has appointed former CTO Andreas Deptolla as president of Atari Europe.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/theres-a-wealth-of-talent-here-our-focus-is-on-how-to-leverage-and-support-it-atari-appoints-andreas-deptolla-as-atari-europe-president\">Read more</a></p>","url":"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/theres-a-wealth-of-talent-here-our-focus-is-on-how-to-leverage-and-support-it-atari-appoints-andreas-deptolla-as-atari-europe-president","timestamp":"2026-07-08T07:48:20Z","extra":{"source_priority":"medium","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
